    <div class="services-list">
      <div class="svc-item"><h3>Not reaching temperature</h3><p>Thermostat, temperature sensor, gas valve, heating element. Temperature verified at set point before leaving.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-item"><h3>Gas ignition failure</h3><p>Igniter, thermocouple, gas valve. Gas supply pressure check and post-repair leak test included.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-item"><h3>Conveyor belt failure</h3><p>Belt drive motor, belt replacement, tension adjustment, finger assembly. Belt failure stops production immediately.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-item"><h3>Uneven baking / hot spots</h3><p>Deck temperature calibration, burner adjustment, airflow assessment on conveyor units.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-item"><h3>Door seal / gasket failure</h3><p>Door gasket replacement. Heat loss from a failed seal causes temperature inconsistency and energy waste.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-item"><h3>Control board failure</h3><p>Digital temperature controller, thermostat replacement, display panel.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-item"><h3>Deck stone cracking</h3><p>Deck stone assessment and replacement. Thermal shock from water on hot stone is the most common cause.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-item"><h3>Burner cleaning &amp; service</h3><p>Burner port cleaning, venturi tube clearing. Recommended annually in LA commercial kitchen environments.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="tip-block">
      <div class="tip-lbl">&#9889; Conveyor oven finger replacement &mdash; LA dust factor</div>
      <p>Lincoln and Middleby Marshall conveyor ovens in LA kitchens accumulate dust and grease in the impinger finger assemblies faster than manufacturer cleaning schedules assume. Restricted airflow through clogged fingers causes uneven baking and forces the oven to run hotter to compensate &mdash; stressing heating elements. Annual finger cleaning is maintenance, not repair. We assess finger condition on every conveyor oven call.</p>
